  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safeguarding livestock production and repairing livestock shelter to protect food security and livelihoods in conflict-affected rural areas of Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall impact of the proposed intervention is to protect the food security and livelihoods in   accessible conflict-affected areas in Ukraine, while laying the foundation for resilient agri-food systems. This will be achieved through one project outcome: rural households engaged in animal rearing activities and located in conflict-affected areas in Donetska, Zaporizka, Kharkivska and Dnipropetrovska oblasts improve shelter conditions for their livestock and maintain/increase their productivity for the next 12 months.</narrative>
  </description>
